# desc: §29② 판단 중 같은 통지서의 §29① 판단을 전제로 재사용한 것은? (결손 judgment-cross-reference)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT ?j ?premise
WHERE {
  ?j a pa:ExaminerJudgment ; pa:onGround pakr:Ground_29_2 ; pa:refersToJudgment ?premise .
  ?premise pa:onGround pakr:Ground_29_1 .
}
ORDER BY ?j ?premise
